<title>HONG KONG: SIFCO launches US$225 mln guaranteed FRN.</title>
<headline>SIFCO launches US$225 mln guaranteed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following guaranteed floating rate notes issue was announced by the joint bookrunners and joint lead managers on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SECURITIZATION &amp; INFRASTRUCTURE FUNDING CORP (SIFCO)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ASIAN SECURITIZATION &amp; INFRASTRUCTURE ASSURANCE</p>
<p>		(PTE) LTD (ASIA LTD)</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$225 MLN  COUPON     3ML+30BP  MATURITY  DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE	LAUNCH    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    **	    REPAYMENT  BULLET    PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p> RATING     --	    SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS    $10/100K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  --	    GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE  19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES	 27.5BP AS   MGT/UND    10BP	SELLING   17.5BP</p>
<p> JOINT LEAD MANAGERS   MORGAN STANLEY ASIA (BOOKS) AND NOMURA</p>
<p>			     SINGAPORE (BOOKS)</p>
<p> PAYING AGENT   BANKERS TRUST CO HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> STABILISING MANAGER   NOMURA SINGAPORE</p>
<p>NOTES  **LISTED IN SINGAPORE AND LUXEMBOURG.</p>
<p>	  DIRECT, UNCONDITIONAL, UNSUBORDINATED, UNSECURED, PARI</p>
<p>	  PASSU.</p>
<p>	  ISSUED OFF US$500 MLN MEDIUM-TERM NOTE PROGRAMME WHICH</p>
<p>	  HAS BEEN RATED AA+ BY NIPPON INVESTORS SERVICES INC, AA</p>
<p>	  BY DUFF &amp; PHELPS CREDIT RATING CO, AND A BY STANDARD AND</p>
<p>	  POOR'S RATINGS SERVICES.</p>
<p>	  CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR/CEDEL.</p>
<p>	  COMMON CODE 7208251, ISIN XS0072082513.</p>
<p>	  THE ISSUE IS EXPECTED TO BE SIGNED AND CLOSED DURING THE</p>
<p>	  WEEK BEGINNING DECEMBER 16.</p>
<p>	  PROCEEDS FROM THE SALE OF THE NOTES WILL BE USED, INTER</p>
<p>	  ALIA, TO PURCHASE CERTAIN INVESTMENTS.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
